# EtUserProfileHeader Component

## Purpose & Scope

`EtUserProfileHeader` is a compound component for displaying user profile information and statistics. It uses a composition pattern for maximum extensibility.

- **User profile display**: Avatar, name, username, copiers count
- **Stats section**: AUM, Copiers, Followers, Following metrics
- **Compound components**: `UserInfo`, `Stats`, `StatItem` subcomponents
- **Context-based**: User data shared via React Context

**Does NOT handle:**

- Navigation logic
- Press interactions
- Follow/unfollow actions (use `EtSocialCard` for that)
- Detailed user statistics or charts
- Edit profile functionality

## Entry Points & Contracts

### `EtUserProfileHeader` (main component)

```tsx
<EtUserProfileHeader
  user={user} // required - user profile info
  accessibility={{
    // optional - accessibility config
    testID: 'user-profile-header',
    accessibilityLabel: "Jessica's profile header",
  }}
>
  <EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo>
    <EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo.Avatar />
    <EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo.Name />
    <EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo.UserName />
    <EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo.Copiers />
  </EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo>
  <EtUserProfileHeader.Stats>
    <EtUserProfileHeader.StatItem label="AUM" value={user.stats.aum} />
    <EtUserProfileHeader.StatItem label="Followers" value={user.stats.followers} />
    <EtUserProfileHeader.StatItem label="Following" value={user.stats.following} />
  </EtUserProfileHeader.Stats>
</EtUserProfileHeader>
```

### Subcomponents

| Subcomponent        | Props                                        | Description                                               |
| ------------------- | -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |
| `UserInfo`          | `ViewProps` + `children`                     | Container for Avatar, Name, UserName, Copiers.            |
| `UserInfo.Avatar`   | `alt: string`                                | Displays user avatar with translated accessibility label. |
| `UserInfo.Name`     | none                                         | Displays user display name from context.                  |
| `UserInfo.UserName` | none                                         | Displays username with @ prefix from context.             |
| `UserInfo.Copiers`  | `text: string`                               | Displays formatted copiers text.                          |
| `Stats`             | `ViewProps`                                  | Container for StatItem children with dividers.            |
| `StatItem`          | `label: string, value: number` + `ViewProps` | Individual stat display with translated label.            |

### Types

| Type                     | Description                                            |
| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| `UserProfileHeaderUser`  | `{ displayName, username, avatar, stats }`             |
| `UserProfileHeaderStats` | `{ aum, copiers, followers, following }` - all numbers |
| `UserInfoProps`          | `ViewProps` + `children`                               |
| `AvatarProps`            | `{ alt }`                                              |
| `CopiersProps`           | `{ text }`                                             |
| `StatsProps`             | `ViewProps`                                            |
| `StatItemProps`          | `{ label, value }` + `ViewProps`                       |

## Usage Patterns

### Standard usage (compound components)

```tsx
const user = {
  displayName: 'Jessica Bale',
  username: 'Jessicab',
  avatar: 'https://example.com/avatar.jpg',
  stats: {
    aum: 1800000,
    copiers: 38000,
    followers: 42500,
    following: 128,
  },
};

<EtUserProfileHeader user={user}>
  <EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo>
    <EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo.Avatar alt="Jessica Bale's avatar" />
    <EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo.Name />
    <EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo.UserName />
    <EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo.Copiers text="38K copiers" />
  </EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo>
  <EtUserProfileHeader.Stats>
    <EtUserProfileHeader.StatItem label="AUM" value={user.stats.aum} />
    <EtUserProfileHeader.StatItem label="Followers" value={user.stats.followers} />
    <EtUserProfileHeader.StatItem label="Following" value={user.stats.following} />
  </EtUserProfileHeader.Stats>
</EtUserProfileHeader>;
```

### With custom styling and onLayout (for animations)

```tsx
<EtUserProfileHeader user={user}>
  <EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo style={{ marginBottom: 16 }} onLayout={(e) => console.log(e.nativeEvent.layout)}>
    <EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo.Avatar alt="User's avatar" />
    <EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo.Name />
    <EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo.UserName />
    <EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo.Copiers text="38K copiers" />
  </EtUserProfileHeader.UserInfo>
  <EtUserProfileHeader.Stats style={{ paddingHorizontal: 8 }} onLayout={(e) => console.log(e.nativeEvent.layout)} />
</EtUserProfileHeader>
```

### Partial UserInfo (only name and username)

```tsx
<EtUserProfileHeader user={user}>
